### ===================================================================
### Practical 5: MongoDB & Mongoose Task Manager API Test Suite (.http)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Server Health & MongoDB Connection Info (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Read All Tasks from MongoDB (GET /tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Filter Tasks by Status (GET /tasks?completed=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create Task - Schema Validation Success (POST /tasks) - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn MongoDB Schema Design with Mongoose",
  "description": "Enforce data validation rules, required fields, and default timestamps",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 5. Create Task - Validation Failure Missing Title (POST /tasks) - 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "This request is missing the required title field."
}

###

### 6. Read Single Task by MongoDB ObjectId (Replace with live _id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Update Task by ObjectId (Replace with live _id) - 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "description": "Updated task description persisting in MongoDB"
}

###

### 8. Delete Task by ObjectId (Replace with live _id) - 200 OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. CastError Test - Invalid ObjectId Format (GET /tasks/invalid-id) - 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid-id-not-objectid
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Test 404 Route Handler - 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Test Global Error Handler Simulation (GET /error-test) - 500 Server Error
GET {{baseUrl}}/error-test
Accept: application/json
